<BlogPost
  title="Discontinued at the End of 2026: Five Terra HPL Colors"
  description="Five HPL colors from Rauvisio's Terra line — Craft Elm, Harvest Walnut, Lakefront Elm, Mission Maple, and Whiskey Oak — are being discontinued by the manufacturer and won't be available after the end of 2026. What to do with open jobs and samples."
  author="Ben Miller"
  publishedDate="2026-10-02"
  ogImage="/images/blog/hpl-terra-colors-discontinued/terra-hpl-discontinued.webp"
