>

<p>W.W. Wood Products has announced that <strong>five HPL colors from Rauvisio's Terra line</strong> are being discontinued by the manufacturer due to low sales volume. These colors <strong>will no longer be available after the end of 2026</strong>.</p>

<div class="post-figure">
  <img src="/images/blog/hpl-terra-colors-discontinued/terra-hpl-discontinued.webp" alt="Swatches of the five discontinued Terra HPL colors: Craft Elm, Harvest Walnut, Lakefront Elm, Mission Maple, and Whiskey Oak" width="1200" height="628" fetchpriority="high" />
</div>

<h2>Colors being discontinued</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Craft Elm</li>
  <li>Harvest Walnut</li>
  <li>Lakefront Elm</li>
  <li>Mission Maple</li>
  <li>Whiskey Oak</li>
</ul>

<h2>What to do now</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Review upcoming project needs.</strong> If a current or upcoming job specifies any of these colors, plan accordingly — and talk to the client now rather than at order time.</li>
  <li><strong>Confirm availability before placing large orders.</strong> Contact customer service promptly so availability can be confirmed before remaining inventory is depleted.</li>
  <li><strong>Check your sample decks and displays.</strong> Remove or flag samples of these colors so they aren't specified on new projects.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Questions</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Pinnacle Sales</strong> — need help picking a replacement color for a client? Send the job through <a href="/dealer-hub/submit/?type=order-check">Submit a Request</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>W.W. Wood Products customer service</strong> — <a href="tel:5736243526">573-624-3526</a> or <a href="mailto:customer.service@wwinc.com">customer.service@wwinc.com</a> to confirm availability on a large order.</li>
</ul>

</BlogPost>

